<https://openark.adaptcentre.ie/Ontologies/nioshControlOntology#EngineeringControl> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Engineering controls reduce exposure by preventing hazards from coming into contact with workers. They still allow workers to do their jobs, though."@en .
<https://openark.adaptcentre.ie/Ontologies/nioshControlOntology#EngineeringControl> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy> <https://openark.adaptcentre.ie/Ontologies/nioshControlOntology#> .
