<https://openark.adaptcentre.ie/Ontologies/nioshControlOntology#PersonalProtectiveEquipment> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/creator> "Nick McDonald" .
<https://openark.adaptcentre.ie/Ontologies/nioshControlOntology#PersonalProtectiveEquipment> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Personal protective equipment (PPE) includes clothing and devices to protect workers. PPE needs constant effort and attention (including proper use and training) from workers. Higher-level controls aren’t always feasible, and PPE might be needed in conjunction with other control measures. Least effective contols."@en .
<https://openark.adaptcentre.ie/Ontologies/nioshControlOntology#PersonalProtectiveEquipment> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy> <https://openark.adaptcentre.ie/Ontologies/nioshControlOntology#> .
